{
  "about": "Column map from the published FOCUS 1.0 sample file (focus_sample.csv in this folder) to the columns of scripts/focus_export.py. FOCUS 1.0 names the provider columns ProviderName and PublisherName; the script's columns are ServiceProviderName and HostProviderName, so the map reads them from there. The sample writes an empty value as the text NULL; the map turns it into an empty cell. Id is kept as x_Id so a converted row points back to its row in the published file. Check before use: FOCUS spec version.",
